{
  "description": "The inventory clock: an older export (exposure, a complete empty snapshot, or a same-named tool in another scope) is refused once a newer one was accepted, an equal stamp is accepted, a damaged clock value fails as in Python, and a legacy file-origin record is both a clock and a retirement candidate.",
